sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API (planned)
    participant Q as Redis queue (planned)
    participant W as Vision worker (planned)
    participant S as PostgreSQL + file storage (planned)

    U->>FE: choose video, classes, thresholds
    FE->>API: POST /api/jobs (video + settings)
    API->>API: validate type, size, settings
    API->>S: save video, create job (queued)
    API->>Q: enqueue job id
    API-->>FE: 201 {id, status: queued}
    FE->>API: GET /api/jobs/{id}/events (SSE)
    Q->>W: job id
    W->>S: read video
    loop every frame
        W->>W: detect, track, motion filter
        W->>Q: progress
        Q-->>API: progress
        API-->>FE: event {progress}
    end
    W->>S: save tracks, crops, clips
    W->>Q: status done
    API-->>FE: event {status: done}
    FE->>API: GET /api/jobs/{id}/tracks
    API->>S: read tracks
    API-->>FE: tracks with boxes
    U->>FE: open results, export
    FE->>API: GET /api/jobs/{id}/report.json
    API-->>FE: report (schema 1.0)
    Note over FE: Today the frontend talks to mock-api.cjs and shows demo overlays
